     1	"""Outlines from the data (E03): fetch a record's inputs, derive WGS84 features, check them.
     2	
     3	  fetch_inputs  the verifier's Opener (paced, robots.txt obeyed) stores each record input as
     4	                parts under build/inputs/<id>/<input>/ with a SHA256SUMS; the input's identity
     5	                is the sha256 of that SHA256SUMS. The only network in this package.
     6	  derive        pure over the stored parts: one extractor per input (rules.yaml, OSD-D11), every
