## Without a period

| record | reason | why |
|---|---|---|
| agl/marmousi2 | synthetic, no date stated | synthetic, no date stated: the AGL downloads page states no release date for the model; the only date is 'Gary Martin Thesis (2004)' for the accompanying report |
| anp/bdep | not stated | ANP access page and the BDEP acervo page state no period for the BDEP holdings; only page dates ('Publicado em 10/11/2020') and dates of free-release resolutions (2021-2023) |
| cnloer/data-information-hub | not stated | C-NLOER geoscience page states no period for the hub or its inventories; only 'Exploration and Delineation Well Test Summaries (May 2016)' for one component |
| geus/deep-subsurface-data | not stated | Portal page states no acquisition, coverage or release range for the holdings; only that 3D/2D seismic downloads began October 2023 (prepared during 2023-2024). data.geus.dk/ugdata2d3d answers 403. |
| lbeg/kw-fis | not stated | KW-FIS page states no coverage, acquisition or release dates (only 'since oil & gas activities began' and 3D seismic 'used in Germany since the mid-1980s'). |
| nopims/poseidon | not stated | AWS Open Data registry page and its registry YAML state no acquisition or release date ('Dataset is static'); nopims.dmp.wa.gov.au/Nopims redirects to a GA NOPIMS landing page (HTTP 200) whose survey search is a JS app with no stated dates; GA eCat search for 'Poseidon 3D' returned no survey record |
| nsta/ndr | not stated | NDR front page states only the Terms of Sale version date (2021-07-01), no coverage or release period; NSTA NDR info page answers 404 |
| ntgs/core-library | not stated | CKAN record and NTLIS ANZLIC metadata leave Data Currency Start/End Date empty; only a citation creation date 2001-03-31 (merge of two datasets in March 2001), not a coverage or release statement |
| opm/norne | not stated | opm-data README and norne/README state no release or acquisition date; the deck header says only 'Copyright (C) 2015 Statoil' and 'Norne full field model for SPE ATW 2013' (event name), simulation START 06 NOV 1997 is a model setting, not a stated period |
| pgi/cbdg-boreholes | not stated | dane.gov.pl record states coverage only as 'od końca XIX wieku do chwili obecnej' (from the end of the 19th century to the present), no year; PGI hosts behind Incapsula |
| rmotc/teapot-dome | blocked | EDX dataset page redirects to the EDX login (HTTP 200 login page); CKAN package_show for the slug answers 404 (not public), package_search for teapot/rmotc does not list it |
| seg/open-data-wiki | blocked | HTTP 403 Cloudflare challenge ('Just a moment...') from wiki.seg.org on both the page and api.php, two tries |
| spe/csp10-model-2 | synthetic, no date stated | synthetic, no date stated (CSP pages name the '2001 SPE Comparative Solution Project' and a Feb 2001 symposium but state no release date for the dataset) |
| tx-rrc/full-wellbore | not stated | data sets page states 'Information on most of the wells ever drilled in Texas' and weekly updates, but no start year or date range; the dump itself is an EBCDIC/ASCII file not read |
| ukogl/uk-onshore-geophysical-library | not stated | archives and about pages state volumes (87,000 km 2D, 2,900 sq km 3D) and that UKOGL was established in 1994, but no acquisition or coverage range for the data |
