    25	2. Items: `start_datetime`/`end_datetime` come from the feature's two properties when both parse
    26	   as dates and start ≤ end; an open end (no completion date) uses the collection period's end;
    27	   otherwise the collection's period is used and the Item carries `osd:period_source:
    28	   collection`. A placeholder rule per source (`period_placeholders: ["1800-01-01"]`) treats listed
